span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You&#x27;ll have to ask at the newsstand.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">果物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">水果</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">果</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">口</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">嘴；口腔；开口；孔；缝隙；开孔；瓶口；壶嘴；喷嘴；吹口；门；门口；出入口；入口；出口；言语；言论；话语；闲话；传言；味道；口味；味觉；要赡养的人；张嘴吃饭的人；空缺；空位；缺额；邀请；召唤；传唤；种类；品种；型号；开始；起始；开端；份；口（用于计量一口食物、钱款份额、炉眼数）；把；口（用于计数刀剑等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173943\"><ruby>口<rp>(</rp><rt>くち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にものをほおばってしゃべるな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Don&#x27;t speak with your mouth full.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">靴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">鞋；靴子；鞋类；鞋靴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179254\"><ruby>靴<rp>(</rp><rt>くつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のほこりをはけではらいなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Brush off the dust from your shoes.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">靴下</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くつした</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">袜子；短袜；长袜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"237401\">この<ruby>靴下<rp>(</rp><rt>くつした</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はちぐはぐだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">These socks do not match.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国家；国土；地区；地方；中央政府；国家政权；故乡；家乡；本国；（日本古代的）令制国；（历史上的）国；陆地；土地；地面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233291\">あなたの<ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>何語<rp>(</rp><rt>なにご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What language do you speak in your country?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">曇り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くもり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">阴云；多云天气；雾气；模糊；朦胧；阴影；暗淡；阴郁；沮丧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123255\"><ruby>曇<rp>(</rp><rt>くも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りの<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It&#x27;s a cloudy day.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">曇る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くもる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">天空阴云；乌云密布；天气转阴；蒙上雾气；起雾；变得模糊；表情阴沉；神情黯淡；面容忧郁；（能剧面具）微微向下倾斜（表示悲伤、哀痛等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146006\"><ruby>蒸気<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でメガネが<ruby>曇<rp>(</rp><rt>くも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The steam has fogged my glasses.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">黑暗的；昏暗的；阴暗的；沮丧的；消沉的；心情阴郁的；（颜色）深暗的；暗淡的；不祥的；可疑的；（来历）不明的；无望的；没有希望的；前景暗淡的；不熟悉的；不了解的；无知的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234367\">あたりがもう<ruby>暗<rp>(</rp><rt>くら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなっていることに<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がついた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I observed that it had already got dark.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">クラス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">班级；课程；阶级；等级</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234637\">あいつはクラスでいちばんのまぬけだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He is the dumbest kid in the class.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n5:v:来る\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">来る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>友達<rp>(</rp><rt>ともだち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">朋友来家里了。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">車</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くるま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">汽车；机动车；车辆；轮子；脚轮</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149061\"><ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のわきの<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をごらんなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Look at the boy beside the car.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">黒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">黑；黑色；黑棋子；有罪；罪人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172985\"><ruby>黒<rp>(</rp><rt>くろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>黒<rp>(</rp><rt>くろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をたしても<ruby>白<rp>(</rp><rt>しろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはならぬ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Two blacks do not make a white.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">黒い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くろい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">黑色的；深色的；黝黑的；晒黑的（皮肤）；可疑的；犯罪的；非法的；污黑的；烟熏的；沾满污垢的；邪恶的；恶毒的；黑心的；不吉利的；凶兆的；不祥的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198990\">ナンシーはヘレンよりもほんのすこし<ruby>色<rp>(</rp><rt>いろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>黒<rp>(</rp><rt>くろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Nancy is a shade darker than Helen.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">グラム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">克；公克</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196880\">プログラムをいただけますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">May I have a program?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">警官</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">警察；警员；巡警</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123109\"><ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>警官<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もへとへとになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The two policemen were exhausted, too.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今朝</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">今天早上；今晨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172291\"><ruby>今朝<rp>(</rp><rt>けさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はとても<ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It was very cold this morning.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">消す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">擦掉；划掉；删除；关闭；熄灭（灯、电视、暖气等）；扑灭；吹灭（火焰、蜡烛等）；除去；消除；解除（气味、疼痛等）；中和（毒素）；淹没；减弱；吸收；压低（声音）；杀死；谋杀；除掉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192284\">ローソクを<ruby>消<rp>(</rp><rt>け</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していただけますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Would you put out the candles?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">結構</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けっこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">出色；美妙；很好；不错；充分；满意；足够；可以；不需要；已经够了；可以；谢谢；相当；颇；十分；意外地；挺；结构；构造；框架；建筑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228472\">いや<ruby>結構<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。たくさんいただきました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">No more, thank you. I&#x27;m full.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">結婚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けっこん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">婚姻；结婚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215406\">ジョンはジェーンと<ruby>結婚<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=