</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222003\">この<ruby>公園<rp>(</rp><rt>こうえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすべての<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>公開<rp>(</rp><rt>こうかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The park is open to everybody.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">交差点</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうさてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">十字路口；交叉口</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231036\">あの<ruby>交差点<rp>(</rp><rt>こうさてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こったのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What happened at that crossing?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紅茶</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうちゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">红茶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173507\"><ruby>紅茶<rp>(</rp><rt>こうちゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かコーヒーはいかがですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Care for tea or coffee?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">交番</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうばん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">派出所；交替；轮换；交替的；交变的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173841\"><ruby>向<rp>(<